  "decision": "exclude",
  "confidence": 1.0,
  "reason": "The study aims to investigate the reproducibility of cancer biology research by attempting to replicate experimental results. However, it does not report any quantitative measure of agreement between non-human animal results and human clinical results, nor does it compare effect sizes between animal and human studies. The focus is on the reproducibility of the animal studies themselves, not their concordance with human clinical outcomes."
